  abilityName: Champion's Furor
  abilityDesc: 5 combo massive Fire attack on single foe (damage relative to remaining
    HP), activates Taunt and greatly boosts own Def for 1 turn, boosts damage reduction
    when guarding for 1 turn, 15% damage reduction from all elemental types for 1
    turn, adds probable evasion for 1 turn & damage taken enormously boosts BB gauge
    for 1 turn
